{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HEB","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"希伯來書","commonName":"希伯來書","title":"希伯來書","order":58,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"78bc9971805314997ff4566e48478a49f397d7d15fa573c9fb560ada92028478","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HEB/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HEB/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":303},"chapter":{"number":8,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["更美之約的大祭司"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我們所講的事，其中第一要緊的，就是我們有這樣的大祭司，已經坐在天上至大者寶座的右邊，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["在聖所，就是真帳幕裏，作執事；這帳幕是主所支的，不是人所支的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["凡大祭司都是為獻禮物和祭物設立的，所以這位大祭司也必須有所獻的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["他若在地上，必不得為祭司，因為已經有照律法獻禮物的祭司。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["他們供奉的事本是天上事的形狀和影像，正如摩西將要造帳幕的時候，蒙上帝警戒他，說：「你要謹慎，作各樣的物件都要照着在山上指示你的樣式。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["如今耶穌所得的職任是更美的，正如他作更美之約的中保；這約原是憑更美之應許立的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["那前約若沒有瑕疵，就無處尋求後約了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["所以主指責他的百姓說",{"noteId":8},"：",{"text":"日子將到，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要與以色列家和猶大家另立新約，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不像我拉着他們祖宗的手，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"領他們出埃及的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與他們所立的約。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們不恆心守我的約，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也不理他們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是主說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主又說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些日子以後，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我與以色列家所立的約乃是這樣：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要將我的律法放在他們裏面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"寫在他們心上；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要作他們的上帝；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要作我的子民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們不用各人教導自己的鄉鄰和自己的弟兄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"說：你該認識主；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們從最小的到至大的，都必認識我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要寬恕他們的不義，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再記念他們的罪愆。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["既說新約，就以前約為舊了；但那漸舊漸衰的，就必快歸無有了。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":8,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：所以主指前約的缺欠說","reference":{"chapter":8,"verse":8}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HEB/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HEB/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/HEB/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}